dhammadesanaṁ.", "Adhigantvā phalaṁ aggaṁ, sobheyyaṁ Jinasāsananti."], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Vinayasaṅgahaṭṭhakathā niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}]}